    title: "Marketing for Canadian Breweries, Wineries and Distilleries: 2026 Guide",
    excerpt: "How Canadian craft producers actually get found: Google Maps, Untappd and Vivino, liquor board listings, provincial advertising rules, and a budget built around a compressed tasting room season.",
